    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "therapy doesnt change what i actually am though. it just puts a bandage on it. the truth is i'm a coward. i saw someone getting hurt and my first instinct was to protect myself instead of them. i think some people are just born fundamentally broken or wrong. like i dont even belong here.",
