      "content": "it just feels like a lie. people say things like \"growth\" and \"reflection\" to make things sound better than they are, but im just existing. like i'm consuming resources and space that maybe better people should have. if someone is fundamentally bad, isn't it just more honest to admit it? how can there be a way forward when the core of me is just... wrong?",
